A row whose every cell is blank is not a table

```
|||
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td></td><td></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| | |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td></td><td></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|= |
.
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col"></th></tr>
  </thead>
</table>
```

```
|a|b|
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|{.x} |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td class="x"></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
|{>} |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td style="text-align: right;"></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
